          <div class="title">
            <h1>RNA Mirage CHSL</h1>
            <p>Address: SK Ahire Marg, Dr Annie Besant Rd, Hanuman Nagar, Worli, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400030</p>
          </div>

          <div class="description">
            <h2>Description</h2>
            <p class="truncate">
              Welcome to RNA Mirage CHSL, a premier residential society located at SK Ahire Marg, Dr Annie Besant Rd, Hanuman Nagar, Worli, in the bustling city of Mumbai, Maharashtra. With a total of 51 houses, this society offers a comfortable and secure living environment for its residents.<br><br>Being in the heart of Mumbai, RNA Mirage CHSL enjoys excellent connectivity to key areas of the city, making it an ideal choice for those seeking convenience and accessibility. The society boasts a high occupancy rate of 94.12%, indicating a strong sense of community and a thriving residential atmosphere.<br><br>Safety and security are given utmost importance in RNA Mirage CHSL, with more than 30-50 guards on duty round the clock. The guards are highly trained and dedicated, ensuring the safety of all residents. Their average rating of 3.8 reflects the society's commitment to maintaining a secure living environment.<br><br>Communication within the society is facilitated through various channels, including notices. With more than 1 notice published regularly, residents are kept informed about important updates and events.<br><br>In addition, RNA Mirage CHSL prides itself on providing excellent support services to its residents. With more than 60-80 daily help profiles available, residents have access to reliable and skilled assistance for their day-to-day needs. The daily help staff receives an average rating of 3.35, affirming their professionalism and competence.<br><br>The society offers a wide range of amenities to cater to the diverse needs and preferences of its residents. From a clubhouse, squash court, and lawn tennis facilities for sports enthusiasts, to a party hall and landscape garden for social gatherings, RNA Mirage CHSL provides ample opportunities for recreation and leisure. A well-equipped gym, swimming pool, spa, and jogging track are also available for residents to maintain their fitness and well-being. Children have their dedicated play area and a separate pool to keep them entertained. Indoor games are provided for all age groups to indulge in fun activities. Additional features like lifts, rainwater harvesting, and power backup ensure convenience and sustainability.<br><br>Apart from the mentioned amenities, RNA Mirage CHSL goes above and beyond by offering dedicated management services, ensuring the smooth functioning of the society. Tutors are available onsite for those seeking educational assistance, and commercial establishments provide convenience right at the doorstep.<br><br>With its strategic location, top-notch facilities, and a strong sense of community, RNA Mirage CHSL stands as a beacon of comfortable and harmonious living in the heart of Mumbai. Come and experience the best of urban living in this prestigious society.
            </p>
            <a id="readMore" class="link">Read more</a>
          </div>

